{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-the-xiang-army","title":"Founding The Xiang Army","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/founding-the-xiang-army","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-taiping-crisis","title":"太平天国之乱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/founding-the-xiang-army/the-taiping-crisis","wordCount":1798,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-an-army","title":"创建湘军","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/founding-the-xiang-army/building-an-army","wordCount":1850,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现曾国藩事业的转折——创建湘军。太平天国起义席卷半个中国、动摇清王朝统治；正是在这场危机中，曾国藩临危受命，从一介文官转变为军事统帅，创建了&quot;湘军&quot;。湘军以独特的编制（兵为将有）、以儒治军的凝聚力、屡败屡战的坚韧，成为镇压太平天国的主力。本章揭示曾国藩从文官到统帅、创建湘军的关键历程。</p>\n"}